link "native_modules/arrays.so" as length_arrays
| `get` only ever declares. A name already in scope is not a name it may
| take — the whole point of forbidding the shadow is that `n = ...` below
| could only ever mean one thing. Pick another name, or `get { value as n }`.
n = "outer"
emit Length { value = [1, 2, 3] } to length_arrays get n
